{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/479239-does-this-sound-like-a-cool-idea-for-a-plot","id":479239,"title":"Does this sound like a cool idea for a plot?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-13T10:43:54-07:00","id":479239,"title":"Does this sound like a cool idea for a plot?","content":"The God-Machine rediscovers one of its Exiles, and a rather old and powerful one at that. The Exile is called the Operator/Slender Man (the latter is more of a nickname). It has worn multiple forms and completed many missions before, usually involving kidnapping individuals who could be reconfigured for the God-Machine to use as important fuel or pawns. In this game, you alternate between playing as the Operator, its Cultists (the Proxies), its Cryptids (which usually start out as urban animals) and other pawns. The missions the God-Machine will give will take you all around the Earth and other planes of existence. You will meet opposition from Demons, Hunters, other supernaturals and even other Angels.<br /> <br /> And who knows...maybe human nature is infectious enough to make even the Operator Fall. Any ideas for what an Unchained Operator's Covers, Demonic Form, Embeds, Exploits, Catalyst, Agenda and personality would be? I have already considered making him a Psychopomp or maybe Analyst, but not much beyond that.<br /> <br /> Edit: I decided to include the Angelic stats he has in my headcanon. They could be used as a rough guideline for his Unchained characteristics.<br /> <br /> Programming: Psychopomp<br /> <br /> Virtue: Hidden<br /> <br /> Vice: Observant<br /> <br /> Rank: 5<br /> <br /> Attributes: Power 15, Finesse 9, Resistance 12<br /> <br /> Corpus: 20 (Size 8)<br /> <br /> Willpower: 10<br /> <br /> Defense: 7<br /> <br /> Initiative Mod: 11<br /> <br /> Speed: 20<br /> <br /> Max Essence/Per Turn: 50/15<br /> <br /> Influence: Perceptions 5, Sigma Radiation 5<br /> <br /> Manifestation: Twilight Form, Materialize, Avernian Gateway, Shadow Gateway, Astral Sojourn<br /> <br /> Ban: the Slender Man is immensely powerful, but he is constrained by the power of the human mind. At the start of each chapter (game session), the Slender Man uses the Aggressive Meme Numen, spreading an evolving mythos about itself to the people of the region. If he steps out of the rules of this mythos, he is reduced to Power 1, Finesse 1 and Resistance 1 (with decreased Advantages) and loses access to Numina, Influences and Manifestations for one scene. The rules must be reasonably coherent in the consciousnesses of the people in the region.<br /> <br /> Bane: anyone who was taken by the Slender Man to a Facility, reconfigured for the God-Machine, reclaimed their original configuration and returned to their home will deal aggravated damage to the Slender Man with all Brawl, Weaponry and Firearms rolls.<br /> <br /> Numina: Aggressive Meme, <a href=\"http://thereachmux.org/wiki/Numina/House_Rules\" target=\"_blank\">Ephemeral Weapon, Ephemeral Armor,</a> Essence Thief, Regenerate, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/480962-ephemeral-being-house-rules-new-epic-numen\">Mirage</a>, Speed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 04-18-2015, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}